  "title": "Apple's iPhone Duo Launch and Market Response",
  "summary": "Apple unveils its first-ever foldable iPhone, the iPhone Duo, alongside the iPhone 18 Pro series, Apple Watch, and AirPods 5, marking a significant step in its strategy to redefine the smartphone market. The new phone features a 5.4-inch outer display, a 7.6-inch inner display, a 'nano-texture' finish, and Touch ID on the power button. Early demand is showing up for the iPhone Duo as analysts assess whether the foldable can lift iPhone pricing and revenue.",
